Cell["\<\
Unlike spatial densities, the energy probability density (RHOE) belongs to \
the 'Field' class, not the 'Recursive' class. Attempting to pass a derivative \
order will safely trigger a signature error.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1705068292,ExpressionUUID->"dcddc802-a0b9-4740-80da-f96a4bd5e325"],

