Cell["\<\
Instantiate a static wavepacket and a dynamic free-particle wavepacket using \
fully symbolic shape and center parameters.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->1345099335,ExpressionUUID->"fddb7b9f-62a9-4bf5-91ec-76df1c675e37"],

