 TemplateBox[{
  "GWPObject", "reqpot", 
   "\"The property \\\"\\!\\(\\*RowBox[{\\\"\\\\\\\"PEX\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\)\\\" \
requires an active dynamic potential. Rebuild the wavepacket using GWP[..., \
\\\"Potential\\\" -> \\\"HO\\\"].\"", 2, 71, 4, 34095537215526299628, "Local",
    "GWPTools`GWPObject"},
  "MessageTemplate2",
  BaseStyle->"MSG"]], "Message",
