Cell["\<\
Evaluate the kinetic energy expectation (EKE). Because kinetic energy depends \
solely on momentum-space kinematics, it evaluates perfectly even for static \
wavepackets.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellID->507082517,ExpressionUUID->"0d377ffe-2538-4abc-91a2-899de2a6465a"],

