Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Parameter Generation & Extraction", "Subsection",
 CellID->1407120056,ExpressionUUID->"3a920f75-ef28-41db-b5bf-567e8ebd60e2"],

Cell["\<\
GWP1DPARAM serves as the primary developer entry point. It accepts a flexible \
range of inputs and automatically extracts relevant physical constants to \
construct the complete 11-element parameter bus. Associated extractor macros \
allow for direct querying of the bus components.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1376860428,ExpressionUUID->"259a10a3-7f0f-4422-8307-e77882d9aa68"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Inspect the developer usage metadata for the primary parameter constructor.\
