Cell["\<\
Behind the scenes, GWP1DPARAM delegates complex dictionary inputs to the \
GWP1D486 parsing engine. This parser routes specific dictionary types to \
dedicated sub-parsers (such as GWP1DSHAPE or GWP1DPHASE). It is important to \
note that neither GWP1D486 nor its associated sub-parsers are intended to be \
called directly by developers or users; they are strictly internal routing \
tools invoked automatically by the main constructor.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1184502722,ExpressionUUID->"6d541807-cede-41d4-b86f-6a646b29710d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Inspect the usage records for the 4-8-6 parser and its specialized dictionary \
sub-parsers.\
