Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Symbolic Assumptions & Performance", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998421454075053*^9, 3.998421473087637*^9}},
 CellID->938441014,ExpressionUUID->"c3eb25a6-f957-43d8-ba5a-be80e1cbb270"],

Cell["\<\
Mathematica's symbolic integration and simplification engines can be \
computationally expensive\[LongDash]or return unresolved conditional \
expressions\[LongDash]if the physical domains of the variables are unknown. \
To resolve this, the engine provides GWP1DASSUMPTIONS, a macro that \
dynamically generates the necessary physical constraints directly from the \
parameter bus (e.g., ensuring mass is positive, spatial spread is strictly \
real and positive, and coordinate centers are real-valued).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9984214890721684`*^9},
 CellID->1789557536,ExpressionUUID->"1f37b17e-e6b6-4ad2-aa56-a7d6c52352ff"],

