Cell["\<\
Energy observables rely on a combination of kinematic properties and the \
local environmental coefficients (V0, V1, V2). While kinetic and potential \
energy expectations support unbounded arbitrary higher-order moments, exactly \
solvable total energy moments are strictly limited to n=4 to maintain \
analytical closure.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->561669923,ExpressionUUID->"128aad09-e5f2-4e11-97d1-a0921ffe24f9"],

